{"id":"en_claimed-by-the-deep","title":"Claimed by the Deep","titleEn":"Claimed by the Deep","description":"Researcher Lia encounters Xavier, a lethal Siren, but mistakes him for a solitary merman. She teaches him songs and dances of courtship, and he takes her as his mate. After she escapes, he abducts her, convinced she has betrayed him twice. Lia then learns their history: as children, he rescued her, though she has no memory of it. Xavier intends to keep her permanently. When she realizes she is pregnant, he releases her, but she captures him instead to make him remain. Their child is born, and the two eventually marry. Xavier, who once lived in isolation, at last has a family.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/claimed-by-the-deep/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/claimed-by-the-deep/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["High Fantasy","Strong Heroine","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscni/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_claimed-by-the-deep_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscni/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_claimed-by-the-deep_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscni/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_claimed-by-the-deep_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscni/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_claimed-by-the-deep_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscni/?pub=4o